  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4442e92a034b2987",
      "translationZh": "我有一台运行 Proxmox 的翻新 Dell R740，里面装了一块 Tesla T4，主要用于做一些本地 CTC 转录工作。不过我觉得 DS4 发布后试试它应该挺有意思，结果表现糟透了，速度只有大约 2 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "602db7f32b89aa20",
      "translationZh": "不过，Qwen3.8 发布时，我又把它拿出来试了试，表现改善了很多，尤其是用 ik_llama 的时候。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73921d53409caee4",
      "translationZh": "Dell R740，2x Xeon Gold 6230，384GB DDR4-2666，一块 Tesla T4 16GB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "54fcf3263aba43fe",
      "translationZh": "客户机 VM 绑定到一个 NUMA 节点：20 个核心，168GB RAM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bdc3dfba9a2a540f",
      "translationZh": "模型：Unsloth Qwen3.8-Flash-Next UD-Q4_K_XL，111GB，总参数 180B / 激活参数 6B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29dbb87ef69a0c86",
      "translationZh": "全部 512 个专家都放在主机 RAM 中（-cmoe），",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7803bc991166b4d4",
      "translationZh": "T4 上的非专家权重：4606 MiB。完整的 256K 上下文可容纳在 13.0GB 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8e6ea69fd606b01",
      "translationZh": "ik_llama.cpp 的 main 分支，加上尚未合并的 PR #2375。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e636574d1aa25aa",
      "translationZh": "-ctv 和 -ictk 都默认为 f16，而且是 KV 占用增长的主要来源；量化后就能容纳 256K。出于同样的原因，-ub 选 1024 而不是 2048。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "811d28c3d7310d9e",
      "translationZh": "在 256K 下使用上述参数：对一个未缓存的 12.5K 提示词，提示词处理速度为 159.6 t/s；短上下文下的生成速度为 17.6 t/s，在 12.5K 上下文下为 16.1 t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2beeaffd51cfbc3d",
      "translationZh": "从 -ub 2048 改为 -ub 1024 会损失一些提示词处理速度（从 193.7t/s 降下来），但生成速度不受影响。将 128K 翻倍到 256K 会使生成速度下降约 2.5%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05570f98d35ab0f6",
      "translationZh": "很有潜力，已经完成了一次扎实的重构，还轻松搞定了几个稍显冷门的 Nim 编程问题和测试。也远比 Opus 简洁，不那么啰嗦、含糊，这是一大优点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d9a927a973f6e1e",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/BusTiny207 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
